# Grant proposal first-draft assembly — variable NAMES only, never values.
# Copy to .env.local (dev) and .env.test (tests). Both are gitignored.

# ── Database ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dev/prod: this project's OWN Neon project. Not shared with the Studio or
# the sibling builds — see "Project boundaries" in CLAUDE.md.
DATABASE_URL=
DIRECT_URL=

# ── Model provider ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GATE: do not populate until the Phase 0 external-provider data-handling
# decision is recorded (P0-AC-10). P0-AC-11 asserts no corpus content was
# processed before that date, and a populated key is how that gets violated.
# Provider-swappable by design — the interface is thin on purpose.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ── App ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where reviewed drafts are exported and where the review queue lives.
# Stack not chosen yet; add its variables here when it is.
